<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended June 20, compared with the June 13 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.62 vs 5.48</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............4.91 vs 4.88</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.64 vs 5.66</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.58 vs 5.60</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.65 vs 5.68</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.65 vs 5.68</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.69 vs 6.80</p>
</text>
